000100*================================================================
000200* POLREC   POLICY MASTER RECORD            CORV.POLMAST  LRECL 400
000300*
000400* THE PERSON WHO HOLDS THE POLICY IS THE "INSURED" ON THE
000500* MAINFRAME. THE SAME PERSON IS PolicyHolder IN policy-admin,
000600* PARTY IN THE ORACLE LEDGER, Customer IN THE PORTAL AND
000700* policyholder IN claims.claim_party.
000800* POL-RISK-DETAIL IS LAID OUT PER LINE OF BUSINESS; EACH RATING
000900* PROGRAM RAT<LINE>01 DEFINES ITS OWN VIEW OF THE 60 BYTES.
001000* PERSONAL DATA: INSURED-DETAILS (NAME, DOB, NI NUMBER, SSN,
001100* ADDRESS, EMAIL).
001200*================================================================
001300 01  POL-RECORD.
001400     05  POL-NUMBER              PIC X(12).
001500     05  POL-LINE-CODE           PIC X(03).
001600     05  POL-STATUS              PIC X(01).
001700         88  POL-IN-FORCE        VALUE 'F'.
001800         88  POL-LAPSED          VALUE 'L'.
001900         88  POL-CANCELLED       VALUE 'C'.
002000     05  POL-REGION              PIC X(02).
002100         88  POL-REGION-UK       VALUE 'UK'.
002200         88  POL-REGION-US       VALUE 'US'.
002300     05  POL-CURRENCY            PIC X(03).
002400     05  INSURED-DETAILS.
002500         10  INSURED-NAME        PIC X(40).
002600         10  INSURED-DOB         PIC 9(08).
002700         10  INSURED-NI-NUMBER   PIC X(09).
002800         10  INSURED-SSN         PIC X(09).
002900         10  INSURED-ADDR-1      PIC X(35).
003000         10  INSURED-ADDR-2      PIC X(35).
003100         10  INSURED-TOWN        PIC X(30).
003200         10  INSURED-POSTCODE    PIC X(10).
003300         10  INSURED-EMAIL       PIC X(60).
003400     05  POL-DATES.
003500         10  POL-START-DATE      PIC 9(08).
003600         10  POL-END-DATE        PIC 9(08).
003700         10  POL-NEXT-BILL-DATE  PIC 9(08).
003800     05  POL-BILL-FREQ           PIC X(01).
003900         88  POL-BILL-MONTHLY    VALUE 'M'.
004000         88  POL-BILL-ANNUAL     VALUE 'A'.
004100     05  POL-SUM-INSURED         PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
004200     05  POL-ANNUAL-PREMIUM      PIC S9(09)V99 COMP-3.
004300     05  POL-VOLUNTARY-EXCESS    PIC 9(05).
004400     05  POL-RISK-SCORE          PIC 9(03).
004500     05  POL-BROKER-ID           PIC X(08).
004600     05  POL-RISK-DETAIL         PIC X(60).
004700     05  FILLER                  PIC X(29).
